# T6007 (2026-08-26).  The subdirectories below hold scratch, generated, or
# superseded fixtures that NO code path reads -- verified by a reference
# sweep over crates/, vendor/, scripts/ and data/**/*.py.  Their contents
# are untracked so the 4open export ships the directory skeleton only,
# while a local working tree keeps the files.  Everything else under
# debug/ IS tracked on purpose: 17 of the 24 tracked subdirectories are
# read by the Rust test suite and must stay.
#
# t602_probe_scratch_* are WRITE targets -- probe_t602.rs regenerates them
# via create_smaller_config(), so the committed copies were stale output.

full_debug/*
!full_debug/.gitkeep
gandcrab_repro/*
!gandcrab_repro/.gitkeep
small_debug_set/*
!small_debug_set/.gitkeep
small_repro_aggr/*
!small_repro_aggr/.gitkeep
t602_probe_scratch_2000/*
!t602_probe_scratch_2000/.gitkeep
t602_probe_scratch_400/*
!t602_probe_scratch_400/.gitkeep
watson_seg5/*
!watson_seg5/.gitkeep
test1.bin
